%% Sprint home-reform-1 — Sequence: GET /api/home/overview
%% Cobre: cache miss (1a chamada), 8 subqueries paralelas Promise.allSettled, timeout 800ms, compose, cache store, response.
%% Tambem ilustra cache hit (2a chamada em <30s) com early return.
%% Renderizavel em https://mermaid.live (sequenceDiagram)
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Pro Player
    participant Browser as Browser (Home.tsx)
    participant TanStack as TanStack Query<br/>staleTime 30s
    participant Auth as requireAuth<br/>(JWT middleware)
    participant Home as routes/home.ts
    participant Cache as Map&lt;userId, {data, expiresAt}&gt;<br/>TTL 30s
    participant Storage as storage.ts
    participant News as routes/news.ts<br/>fetchNewsItems()
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,DB: 1a chamada (cache MISS) — budget < 500ms p95
    User->>Browser: Navega para /
    Browser->>TanStack: useQuery(['/api/home/overview'])
    TanStack->>Auth: GET /api/home/overview<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    Auth->>Auth: Valida JWT, extrai userId
    Auth->>Home: req.user = { id: userId, ... }
    Home->>Cache: get(userId)
    Cache-->>Home: undefined (miss)

    Note over Home,DB: Promise.allSettled — 8 subqueries paralelas, timeout 800ms cada

    par statusStrip data
        Home->>Storage: getQuickStats(userId)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT lifetime totals
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: quickStats
    and dashboard performance 30d
        Home->>Storage: getDashboardPerformance(userId, '30d')
        Storage->>DB: SELECT ROI/ITM/Cash + sparkline
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: performance
    and recent sessions top 5
        Home->>Storage: getRecentSessions(userId, 5)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM grind_sessions LIMIT 5
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: recentSessions
    and pending starred hands top 5
        Home->>Storage: getPendingStarredHands(userId, 5)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM starred_hands WHERE status='pending' LIMIT 5
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: pendingHands
    and today (planned + profile)
        Home->>Storage: getPlannedTournamentsForDate(userId, today, tz)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT WHERE start_time::date=today
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: planned[]
        Home->>Storage: getProfileStateForDay(userId, dayOfWeek)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM profile_states WHERE day=N
        DB-->>Storage: row
        Storage-->>Home: profile
    and bankroll current
        Home->>Storage: getCurrentBankroll(userId)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM wallets / bankroll_snapshots
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: banca
    and cooldown active
        Home->>Storage: getActiveCooldown(userId)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM cooldown_logs WHERE status='active'
        DB-->>Storage: row | null
        Storage-->>Home: cooldown | null
    and flight series active
        Home->>Storage: getActiveFlightSeries(userId)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT FROM tournament_series WHERE status='active'
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        Storage-->>Home: flight | null
    and news (Onda 1: stub)
        Home->>News: fetchNewsItems('poker-software', 5)
        News->>News: NEWS_FEED_ENABLED=false<br/>return []
        News-->>Home: { items: [], enabled: false }
    end

    Note over Home: Compose response<br/>userState = totalTournaments>=50 && totalSessions>=5 ? 'power' : 'empty'

    Home->>Cache: set(userId, { data, expiresAt: now + 30000 })
    Home-->>Auth: 200 + HomeOverviewResponse<br/>+ meta.cacheHit=false<br/>+ meta.subqueryTimingsMs
    Auth-->>TanStack: JSON response<br/>Cache-Control: private, max-age=30
    TanStack-->>Browser: data (cached client 30s)
    Browser-->>User: Render cockpit em &lt;500ms

    Note over User,DB: 2a chamada (cache HIT) — < 50ms p95<br/>(user retorna a Home em < 30s)
    User->>Browser: Refresh / volta foco janela
    Browser->>TanStack: refetch (refetchOnWindowFocus=true)
    TanStack->>Auth: GET /api/home/overview
    Auth->>Home: req.user
    Home->>Cache: get(userId)
    Cache-->>Home: { data, expiresAt: future } HIT
    Home-->>Auth: 200 + cached data<br/>+ meta.cacheHit=true
    Auth-->>TanStack: JSON
    TanStack-->>Browser: data
    Browser-->>User: Re-render &lt;50ms

    Note over Home: Subquery timeout 800ms<br/>se exceder, vira null no campo correspondente<br/>response continua 200 (graceful degradation)

    Note over Home: Subquery throw<br/>Promise.allSettled captura, vira null<br/>log [home/overview] error nivel error<br/>response continua 200
